{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fFIYMvUUWKqpdoD8RKOAGw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:15.310216+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fFIYMvUUWKqpdoD8RKOAGw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>电子科技大学光电科学与工程学院将于<span>7月13日-7月14日</span>举办2026年第八届“光引未来”全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营。采用线上线下相结合的方式，包括学术讲座、团队宣讲、导师交流等活动。</span></span></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.全国高校普通<span>全日制本科三年级</span>光电信息科学与工程、电子科学与技术、光源与照明、应用物理学、材料物理与化学、通信工程等专业的理工科在校生（2027届毕业生）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.对光学工程专业有较浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事相关领域学术研究或工程应用工作；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学习成绩优秀，英语水平良好，有意申请我院硕士或博士研究生。</span></span></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请方式及流程</span></strong></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>1.网上报名</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>申请者须在电子科技大学夏令营报名系统进行网报，填写相关信息，网址：</span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://yzbm.uestc.edu.cn/logon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yzbm.uestc.edu.cn/logon</a></span></span><span><span>（选择招生项目为“全国优秀大学生夏令营”），</span><strong><span>系统预计7月1日9:00开放，7月5日16:00关闭</span></strong><span>，过期不再接受申请。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.电子材料提交</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>申请者还需在网上报名系统提交以下材料的电子档：</span></span></p><p><span><span>①个人简历1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>②教育部学籍在线验证报告（中国高等教育学生信息网：</span></span><span><span><a href=\"http://www.chsi.com.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">www.chsi.com.cn</a></span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>③身份证复印件（正反面在同一页）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>④本科阶段前五个学期成绩单1份（须加盖院系或学校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>⑤相关个人能力证明材料（如国家英语四、六级证书等英语水平证明材料；已发表学术论文、专利或原创性工作成果；各类获奖、资格证书、参与科研项目情况等体现自身学习和工作能力的材料）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：以上申请材料1-5项请通过扫描等方式合并成</span><strong><span>一份</span></strong><strong><span>PDF</span></strong><strong><span>格式</span></strong><span>的电子文件（不超过10M），文件名为：</span><strong><span>学校名称</span></strong><strong><span>-</span></strong><strong><span>姓名</span></strong><strong><span>-</span></strong><strong><span>夏令营报名材料</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.资格审查</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>我院将对申请者的网上报名信息和提交的电子材料进行资格审核，择优确定入选夏令营营员，入选名单将于7月6日公布在学院网站，网址：</span></span><span><span><a href=\"https://sose.uestc.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://sose.uestc.edu.cn/</a></span></span><span><span>，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></span></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>夏令营安排</span></strong></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>7月13日：线下营员报到，开营仪式、团队宣讲；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7月14日：团队宣讲、导师交流、研究生招生政策解答、离营仪式。</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：本日程为拟定计划，如有变化请以最新通知为准。</span></span></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.联系人：薛老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.联系电话：028-61838801</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.地址：成都市高新西区西源大道2006号，电子科技大学清水河校区4号科研楼B区409光电科学与工程学院研究生管理办公室</span></span></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.</span><strong><span>学生可选择线上或线下任一形式参加，对于线下参加的同学，餐饮、交通、住宿等费用一律自行解决。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>2.夏令营期间营员须遵守活动的要求与纪律。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><strong><span>申请者请加入2026电子科大光电学院夏令营QQ群:373615475。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><strong><span>凡有意参加我院“优秀本科生选拔计划”的同学，请参见通知</span></strong><span>：</span></span><span><span><a href=\"https://sose.uestc.edu.cn/info/1071/11543.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">光电科学与工程学院2026年“优秀本科生选拔计划”-光电科学与工程学院</a></span></span></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></s